ated pay received in Q2 2024.\r\n\r\nELC quarterly estimates were updated on 29/05/2024 to incorporate updated population estimates for the period 2016 Q3 to 2023 Q4, based on the results of Census 2022.\r\n\r\nThe Building Momentum Public Service Agreement 2021-2022 introduced an increase in the annualised basic salaries for public servants of 3%, which was backdated to 02 February 2022, with some or all backdated pay received in Q4 2022.\r\n\r\nFor more information, please go to the [url=https://www.cso.ie/en/statistics/earnings/earningsandlabourcosts/]statistical release[/url] page and [url=https://www.cso.ie/en/methods/earnings/earningshoursandemploymentcostssurvey/]Background Notes[/url]."], "role": {"metric": ["STATISTIC"], "time": ["TLIST(Q1)"]}, "size": [3, 2, 2], "updated": "2026-08-25T11:00:00.000Z", "value": [862.97, 1572.11, 872.08, 2051.95, 24.32, 39.22, 24.33, 51.23, 35.5, 40.1, 35.8, 40.1], "version": "2.0"}, "EHQ58": {"class": "dataset", "dimension": {"STATISTIC": {"category": {"index": ["EHQ58C01", "EHQ58C02", "EHQ58C03"], "label": {"EHQ58C01": "Earnings Per Week", "EHQ58C02": "Average Hourly Earnings", "EHQ58C03": "Average Weekly Paid Hours"}, "unit": {"EHQ58C01": {"decimals": 2, "label": "Euro", "position": "end"}, "EHQ58C02": {"decimals": 2, "label": "Euro", "position": "end"}, "EHQ58C03": {"decimals": 1, "label": "Euro", "position": "end"}}}, "label": "Statistic"}, "TLIST(Q1)": {"category": {"index": ["20254", "20261"], "label": {"20254": "2025Q4", "20261": "2026Q1"}}, "label": "Quarter"}, "C04498V05282": {"category": {"index": ["C18", "C21"], "label": {"C18": "Printing and Reproduction of Recorded Media (C18)", "C21": "Manufacture of Basic Pharmaceutical Products and Pharmaceutical Preparations (C21)"}}, "label": "NACE Rev 2.1 Economic Sector"}}, "extension": {"matrix": "EHQ58", "reasons": ["Planned Routine Revision"], "language": {"code": "en", "name": "English"}, "elimination": {"C04498V05282": null}, "contact": {"name": "Niall O'Sullivan", "